===Etymology===
From Ancient Greek [[πτερόν#Ancient%20Greek|πτερόν]] (pterón, “wing”) +[[σαῦρος#Ancient%20Greek|σαῦρος]] (saûros, “lizard”), literally translating to "wing lizard".

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtɛɹəˌsɔɹ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[flying]] [[reptile]]s, of the [[extinct]] [[order]] ''[[Pterosauria]]'', including the [[pterodactyl]]s. {{defdate|from ''c''. 1860}}

